OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire vineyards embrace merlot
OL,4,Aas climate changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FVineyards in Yorkshire are
OL,7,Fexperimenting with the growing of
OL,8,Fgrapes typically found in southern
OL,9,FEurope as summers become hotter and
OL,10,Flonger.
OL,12,FWineries in the region are set for a
OL,13,Frecord-breaking harvest following a dry
OL,14,Fand warm growing season, after they
OL,15,Fproduced more than 140,000 bottles in
OL,16,F2025.
OL,18,FThis year, Wine GB anticipates
OL,19,FYorkshire's producers will surpass that
OL,20,Ffigure, with vineyards looking at ways
OL,21,Fof growing new varieties as the climate
OL,22,Fshifts.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
