OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire vineyards embrace merlot
OL,4,Aas climate changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 100 vines of merlot have been
OL,7,Fplanted at Yorkshire Heart near York,
OL,8,Fwhere owner Tim Spakouskas says: "If it
OL,9,Fdoes well, we'll plant more of it, and
OL,10,Fhopefully rely on the summer that we're
OL,11,Fgetting to help produce a really good
OL,12,Fquality merlot wine."
